            "review_title": "Review at Bon's Vegan",
            "review_text": "DLTT2015\nLondon, United Kingdom1007 contributions\n0\nYummy Vegan Banh Mi!\nFeb 2023 • Friends\nI was happy to find a good vegan Banh mi place in Hanoi! This was my favourite I found in the city. \n\nI had the mushroom floss Banh Mi. This was fresh and so flavour full! It was also packed with all the traditional fresh salad. It was only 25k / £1.\n\nBond vegan also had lots of other vegan Bahn Mi options as well as other dishes. They had a variety of vegan milks also!\n\nGreat find!\nRead more\nWritten February 15, 2023",
